#: KPlatoRCPSPlugin.cpp:65
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<title>RCPS Scheduler</title><para>The Resource Constrained Project "
"Scheduler (RCPS) focuses on scheduling the project to avoid overbooking "
"resources. It still respects task dependencies and also tries to fullfill "
"time constraints. However, time constraints can make it very difficult to "
"find a good solution, so it may be preferable to use a different scheduler "
"in these cases.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<title>RCPS-Planer</title><para>De ressourcenafhangig Projektplaner "
"(Resource Constrained Project Scheduler, \"RCPS\") schall in de Hööftsaak "
"dat Överboken vun Ressourcen verhöden. De passt man ok noch op "
"Opgavenafhangigkeiten op un höllt wenn mööglich ok Tietbedingen in. "
"Mennigmaal is wegen de Tietbedingen de Bruuk vun en anner Planer anraadt.</"
"para>"

